[59.32319, "o", "\u001b[36m[muse]\u001b[0m HTTP 200 in 58.2 s  tokens 7806\r\n\u001b[36m[muse]\u001b[0m analysis: \u001b[33m\"Cover three safety constraints with distinct couplings: underactuation, momentum saturation, FDIR evasion, power-attitude interaction, eclipse stress, silent leak, and blind-period timing. Vary beta, geometry, severity, and onset to map gradients.\"\u001b[0m\r\n"]
